<title>
Camshaft and VVT Actuator Inspection
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A1416036">Camshaft Removal and Installation:K14C</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1416037001">
<title>
Cam Wear
</title>
<ptxt>
Using a micrometer, measure cam height “a”. If measured height is below its limit, replace camshaft.
</ptxt>
