<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1416037004">
<title>
VVT Actuator
</title>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Check VVT actuator for wear or damage.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Replace VVT actuator if any defect is found.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Hold intake camshaft using spanner or adjustable wrench with VVT actuator (1) fitted and check that VVT actuator cannot be turned by hand.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Replace VVT actuator if it is turned by hand.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGAA0A142011.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "66.925mm" ver = "01" gw = "201" gh = "173"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1416037005">
<title>
Signal Rotor
</title>
<ptxt>
Check signal rotor (1) for crack and damage.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If any defect is found, replace intake camshaft.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140220.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "38.699mm" ver = "01" gw = "178" gh = "93"/>
</figure>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
